decide  if you're thinking of starting a  business if you've got a great idea you  think you can make something that will  change the world then you need to decide  if you're going to do this or not  a lot of entrepreneurs come to me and  they're  they're on the fence you know you've got  what you think is a great idea but you  don't know how to sell it how to start  how to fund it all these problems all  these questions come up all of those  things can be solved  but you have to decide that this is for  you because i can give you practical  advice wisdom strategies and you can get  it from other places as well  but none of that is going to help you  until you decide that this is for you  until you make that commitment that you  are going to be an entrepreneur and  you're going to find a way to make this  work too many want to be entrepreneurs  you sit on the fence  you sit on the fence you don't commit  you don't decide you don't make this  happen  and so people can give you strategies  and ideas and motivation but it doesn't  work because you haven't committed to  yourself that you're going to make this  happen  that's the very first thing you need to  do  and once you make that decision  doors will open up  and you'll find  solutions to the problems you think you  have a lot of problems now wait till you  get started because you're going to get  hit with a million new problems and all  of those can be solved as well once you  decide to take action and commit to  being an entrepreneur and make your  company work  here's a quick example that i'm sure you  can relate to  think about the last time you bought a  new car or you're renting a car whatever  you made a decision i'm gonna get this  car  have you ever noticed then on the street  that there's so many people driving that  car  it's not like everybody went out at the  same week and bought the same car as you  did they were always there but now  you're noticing it in your environment  because you made a decision to buy that  car  the same thing happens in your business  once you decide to be an entrepreneur  you'll notice things in your environment  that weren't there before that you never  noticed before  that can help you grow and can help you  get to the next step but you have to  make that decision this is something  that i don't have a lot of empathy for  usually when entrepreneurs write into me  i can tell a story about how i solve  that problem you know you're trying  you're talking about struggling you're  talking about getting your first  customer you're talking about raising  capital for your business all of these  things i went through i struggled i  suffered i was making 300 bucks a month  i didn't know what how i was going to  survive  but this one not deciding  i don't have a lot of empathy for  because i've never been a dreamer  if i want something i go out and i start  taking action immediately  i don't know what i'm going to be in  five years 10 years 20 years  if i want something i don't say  in 10 years i'm going to be this i go  out and do it right now i find a way a  small way to get started i don't know  how the whole thing is going to work out  but i find a way to get started to take  action because you can't be a dreamer  you have to be a doer an example i  wanted to build a house i want to build  my dream house  and i didn't know how i was gonna afford  it i didn't know what it was gonna cost  i didn't know any architects i didn't  know anything about layout furniture  none of that stuff i didn't know any of  that stuff but once i made that decision  i want to build a house  it wasn't months of i think i should  build the house i wish i built the house  in 10 years here's the house i want to  have i went out and i started doing it  i made an appointment with a real estate  agent started doing tours found a lot in  an area that i liked i bought it  then i found the construction company  and i found an architect and i found  designers and i found everything i  needed to build this house  i made it happen  so i'm not a dreamer and if you want to  have success as an entrepreneur you  can't just be a dreamer you've got to be  a doer you've got to take action on what  you want to happen  now that's not saying you don't have to  have a big vision  i want to help a billion entrepreneurs  that's my vision that's my goal and  every day i'm taking action to move  closer to that goal  that's a big picture thing i want to  accomplish  you guys watching this video right now  you're helping me get to my goal  so whatever you have as a goal your  vision whatever it is you have to take  steps you got to commit to it you got to  say this is going to happen i'm going to  find a way until you do that you're not  going to have success and all the people  who try to help you  their words are gonna fall on deaf ears  you may say that's a great idea yeah i  should really do that wow that's that's  some great advice you gotta take it you  gotta take action you have to do  something  you've gotta commit to  yourself this is all in response to an  email that came in from one of my  facebook fans stephen and steven has  this idea for a business  selling christmas cakes from his nana's  great recipe  and he wrote this whole long thing but  the summary is he's got this great  recipe this is nana's recipe everybody  says you've got this great thing you  should go out and you should make this a  business and he's on the fence he  doesn't know how to fund it he doesn't  know how to get it started he doesn't  know if it should be a seasonal thing or  full-time business he doesn't know if he  can do it while still doing his job he  doesn't know what to do  there's tons of steps that you can do  there's tons of ways to promote this  business you can partner up with  different companies you can make it a  seasonal business to start and see if  you like it you can partner up with  online websites who have a market that  you can tap into you could partner up  with media or bloggers or people who can  spread your message you're talking to me  about your favorite christmas cake and  how great this is how everybody loves it  send me a cake  right let me try it let me tell the  world about it if i love a product i  talk about it i tell my friends i make a  video about it  so don't just send the message send the  cake right this is how you can get out  there  but none of this matters none of these  steps matter until you commit to making  this happen  you have to decide  i'm going to be an entrepreneur i'm  going to find a way to make my dream  happen and when you do that you start  finding solutions and you start  acting on them  so if you're on the fence right now  i get that it's tough i get that it's  scary i get that  you may not have done this before you're  worried about putting your family at  risk you want to put in your job at risk  but if you love this idea  i don't want you to sit around for the  next 20 years and wish that you had done  something about it look back on your  life and say  wow that was such a great idea and you  watch other people make tons of money  off of it where you could have had that  impact that could have been you  it's hard it's scary  but if you want  this dream to happen  you've got to stop dreaming  you've got to start being a doer start  taking action and it begins with a  simple decision  decide that you're going to be an  entrepreneur decide that this dream is  going to happen for you and you're going  to start today and do something today  and do something tomorrow and do  something the next day every day taking  small actions  to move your business forward and i'm  not saying get off the fence and jump  into the deep end i'm not saying get out  the fence and quit your job and go crazy  full-time for three months and then burn  through your cash and run out and have  to go back and get a job okay that's not  my message  get off the fence and start small that's  cool keep your job  start part-time but you started you made  a decision things are happening  until you decide  until you go from being a wannabe  entrepreneur to doing something and  being a real entrepreneur even part-time  but you're an entrepreneur now  until you make that decision nothing's  going to happen to you nothing will  happen and all the advice wisdom ideas  in the world will not help you until you  decide to become an entrepreneur  so make that decision and make it  powerfully  believe  for those of you watching you liked the  video please give it a thumbs up below  it makes me want to do more for you and  let me know what you think  let me know how you decided to be an  entrepreneur if you have a question for  your business leave it in the comments  below i'd make a video response for you  thank you so much and i'll see you soon  you

